@baseUrl = http://localhost:5052/api/v1

### 1. Create a cover (starts tomorrow, 6 months)
# @name createCover
POST {{baseUrl}}/covers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "{{$datetime "yyyy-MM-dd" 1 d}}",
  "endDate": "{{$datetime "yyyy-MM-dd" 181 d}}",
  "type": "Yacht"
}

### 2. Get the cover
GET {{baseUrl}}/covers/{{createCover.response.body.$.id}}

### 3. List covers
GET {{baseUrl}}/covers?page=1&pageSize=10

### 4. Quote a premium without creating a cover
GET {{baseUrl}}/covers/premium?startDate={{$datetime "yyyy-MM-dd" 1 d}}&endDate={{$datetime "yyyy-MM-dd" 366 d}}&coverType=Tanker

### 5. Create a claim under the cover
# @name createClaim
POST {{baseUrl}}/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coverId": "{{createCover.response.body.$.id}}",
  "name": "Hull damage in port",
  "type": "Collision",
  "damageCost": 25000,
  "created": "{{$datetime "yyyy-MM-dd" 10 d}}"
}

### 6. Get the claim
GET {{baseUrl}}/claims/{{createClaim.response.body.$.id}}

### 7. List claims
GET {{baseUrl}}/claims?page=1&pageSize=10

### 8. Delete the claim (204), then step 6 returns 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/claims/{{createClaim.response.body.$.id}}

### 9. Delete the cover
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/covers/{{createCover.response.body.$.id}}

### Validation: damage cost above 100.000 and created date outside the cover -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coverId": "{{createCover.response.body.$.id}}",
  "name": "Total loss",
  "type": "Fire",
  "damageCost": 150000,
  "created": "{{$datetime "yyyy-MM-dd" 400 d}}"
}

### Validation: start date in the past and period longer than one year -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/covers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "{{$datetime "yyyy-MM-dd" -1 d}}",
  "endDate": "{{$datetime "yyyy-MM-dd" 400 d}}",
  "type": "Tanker"
}

### Health
GET http://localhost:5052/health/ready
